OL,3,ADutch police arrest suspected member of
OL,4,Agroup that claimed FBI hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDutch police have arrested a suspected
OL,7,Fmember of the ShinyHunters cyber-crime
OL,8,Fgroup that claimed to have stolen
OL,9,Fsensitive information on all FBI bureau
OL,10,Fstaff - around 38,000 people.
OL,12,FAfter the alleged attack last week, the
OL,13,Fgroup claimed to have every agent's
OL,14,Fname, role, badge number and personal
OL,15,Fdetails including home address and
OL,16,Fphone numbers.
OL,18,FIn a statement, Dutch police said it
OL,19,Fhad arrested a 24-year-old man from
OL,20,FAmsterdam on suspicion of being part of
OL,21,Fthe group, which has also claimed other
OL,22,Fhacks.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
