OL,3,ADutch police arrest suspected member of
OL,4,Agroup that claimed FBI hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect was arrested on 15
OL,7,FSeptember, before the alleged FBI
OL,8,Fattack. He is also suspected of
OL,9,Fattempted incitement to commit two
OL,10,Fmurders, police said.
